SDV test1:
VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)

    Actuator Signal FrontBrake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal RearBrake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
 
App :
    Component AEBS_controler 
        subscribe (Rad) to VSS signal Camera 
        subscribe to VSS signal Lidar 

        publish to VSS signal FrontBrake
        publish Alarm
        service s1:
            triggered on Rad 
            ExecTime 3+/-1ms

    Component Test 
        subscribe to Alarm
        publish to VSS signal RearBrake
        service s1:
            periodic 10+/-1ms
            ExecTime 3+/-1ms